<title>NEW ZEALAND: Roberts appointed GM TVNZ Television.</title>
<headline>Roberts appointed GM TVNZ Television.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The former chairman of Communicado, Neil Roberts, has been appointed General Manager of TVNZ Television, TVNZ said on Friday.</p>
<p>Roberts replaces Mike Lattin.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
